1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,867
12:50 AM. The heaters under the seats
click on. And they don't click off.

2
00:00:05,367 --> 00:00:10,533
The car fills with hot, dry air. Coal
dust drifts out of the vents. Your
chest goes tight.

3
00:00:11,033 --> 00:00:13,433
How many puffs are left? The truth
this time.

4
00:00:13,933 --> 00:00:16,633
Two. I'm not lying to you again. Two
puffs.

5
00:00:17,133 --> 00:00:21,500
Out for four. In for two. My dad's
count. It buys me time, but not a lot.

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:27,100
Rule seven. When the air goes bad, get
low. The cleanest air is near the
floor.

7
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:31,100
You crouch by the floor. It's a little
better. One puff. One left.
